{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT AGAINST WAVES OF ZOMBIES, MONSTERS AND DEMON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/gif2.gif?t=1736957823\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of ranged and melee weapons to defend yourself against waves of different enemy types at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>USE YOUR TEAMMATES, STRUCTURES AND ITEMS TO WIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/gif3.gif?t=1736957823\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use weapons, structures, teammates and items correctly to gain an advantage through synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAKE THE RIGHT DECISIONS AT DAYTIME TO SURVIVE THE NIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/gif4.gif?t=1736957823\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core gameplay loop alternates between day and night. During the day, decisions are made and teammates, structures, weapons or items are purchased. At night, fighting takes place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STAND YOUR WAY THROUGH SKILL AND STRATEGY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/gif1.gif?t=1736957823\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some waves are boss waves, where you face enemies with the character of a final boss. A good strategy during the day and skill at night will be required to defeat these powerful enemies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395840?t=1736957823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta